  "domain": "machine-learning",
  "definition": "A recommendation technique that suggests items by matching the attributes of items a user has previously engaged with \u2014 such as text features, genres, tags, or learned embeddings \u2014 against the attributes of candidate items, building a per-user preference profile in feature space; it requires no data about other users, handles new items gracefully, and offers explainable suggestions, but tends to over-specialise, recommending only items similar to what the user already knows.",
